# WordPress Theme Standards

## Theme Structure

```
skeleton/
├── assets/
│   ├── scss/
│   │   ├── abstracts/
│   │   │   ├── _variables.scss
│   │   │   ├── _functions.scss    # fluid(), strip-unit()
│   │   │   └── _mixins.scss       # media-breakpoint-up()
│   │   ├── base/
│   │   │   ├── _reset.scss
│   │   │   └── _typography.scss
│   │   ├── components/
│   │   ├── layout/
│   │   └── style.scss
│   ├── js/
│   │   └── main.js
│   ├── css/                       # Compiled CSS
│   └── images/
├── inc/
│   ├── setup.php                  # Theme setup
│   ├── enqueue.php                # Scripts & styles
│   ├── template-functions.php     # Template helpers
│   ├── template-tags.php          # Custom template tags
│   └── customizer.php             # Customizer settings
├── template-parts/
│   ├── content/
│   │   ├── content.php
│   │   ├── content-single.php
│   │   └── content-none.php
│   ├── header/
│   └── footer/
├── functions.php
├── style.css                      # Theme header only
├── index.php
├── header.php
├── footer.php
├── sidebar.php
├── single.php
├── page.php
├── archive.php
├── search.php
├── 404.php
└── screenshot.png
```

## Critical Rules Summary

### SCSS - NEVER Do These
```scss
// ❌ Raw px values
font-size: 18px;
padding: 24px;

// ❌ @media directly
@media (min-width: 768px) { }

// ❌ Desktop-first / breakpoint-down
@include media-breakpoint-down(md) { }

// ❌ Inline styles in PHP
style="color: red;"
```

### SCSS - ALWAYS Do These
```scss
// ✅ Use fluid()
font-size: fluid(16px, 18px);
padding: fluid(16px, 24px);

// ✅ Use media-breakpoint-up() only
@include media-breakpoint-up(md) { }
@include media-breakpoint-up(lg) { }

// ✅ Mobile-first approach
.component {
  // Mobile styles first (default)
  font-size: fluid(14px, 16px);

  @include media-breakpoint-up(md) {
    // Tablet and up
  }

  @include media-breakpoint-up(lg) {
    // Desktop and up
    font-size: fluid(18px, 24px);
  }
}
```

### PHP - ALWAYS
```php
// ✅ Escape all output
echo esc_html( $text );
echo esc_attr( $attribute );
echo esc_url( $url );

// ✅ Sanitize all input
$clean = sanitize_text_field( $_POST['field'] );

// ✅ Use text domain
__( 'Text', 'skeleton' );

// ✅ Prefix all functions
function skeleton_function_name() { }

// ✅ Use WordPress hooks
add_action( 'wp_enqueue_scripts', 'skeleton_enqueue_scripts' );
add_filter( 'body_class', 'skeleton_body_classes' );
```

### JavaScript - ALWAYS
```javascript
// ✅ IIFE with strict mode
( function() {
    'use strict';
    // Code here
} )();

// ✅ Spaces in parentheses
if ( condition ) { }
document.querySelector( '.selector' );

// ✅ const/let, never var
const element = document.querySelector( '.element' );
```

## Required Theme Files

### style.css (Header Only)
```css
/*
Theme Name: Skeleton
Theme URI: https://example.com/skeleton
Author: Your Name
Author URI: https://example.com
Description: A custom WordPress theme
Version: 1.0.0
Requires at least: 6.0
Tested up to: 6.4
Requires PHP: 8.0
License: GNU General Public License v2 or later
License URI: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html
Text Domain: skeleton
Tags: custom-background, custom-logo, custom-menu
*/

/* Note: All styles should be in assets/css/main.css */
```

### functions.php
```php
<?php
/**
 * Theme functions and definitions
 *
 * @package Skeleton
 */

// Prevent direct access
if ( ! defined( 'ABSPATH' ) ) {
    exit;
}

// Define constants
define( 'SKELETON_VERSION', '1.0.0' );
define( 'SKELETON_DIR', get_template_directory() );
define( 'SKELETON_URI', get_template_directory_uri() );

// Include files
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/setup.php';
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/enqueue.php';
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/template-functions.php';
require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/template-tags.php';

// Conditional includes
if ( is_admin() ) {
    require SKELETON_DIR . '/inc/admin.php';
}
```

### index.php
```php
<?php
/**
 * The main template file
 *
 * @package Skeleton
 */

get_header();
?>

<main id="main-content" class="site-main">
    <?php
    if ( have_posts() ) :
        while ( have_posts() ) :
            the_post();
            get_template_part( 'template-parts/content/content', get_post_type() );
        endwhile;

        the_posts_pagination( array(
            'prev_text' => esc_html__( 'Previous', 'skeleton' ),
            'next_text' => esc_html__( 'Next', 'skeleton' ),
        ) );
    else :
        get_template_part( 'template-parts/content/content', 'none' );
    endif;
    ?>
</main>

<?php
get_sidebar();
get_footer();
```

## Hooks Reference

### Common Actions
```php
// Theme setup
add_action( 'after_setup_theme', 'skeleton_setup' );

// Enqueue assets
add_action( 'wp_enqueue_scripts', 'skeleton_enqueue_scripts' );

// Widgets
add_action( 'widgets_init', 'skeleton_register_sidebars' );

// Custom post types
add_action( 'init', 'skeleton_register_post_types' );

// Admin
add_action( 'admin_menu', 'skeleton_add_admin_menu' );
add_action( 'admin_enqueue_scripts', 'skeleton_admin_scripts' );
```

### Common Filters
```php
// Body classes
add_filter( 'body_class', 'skeleton_body_classes' );

// Excerpt
add_filter( 'excerpt_length', 'skeleton_excerpt_length' );
add_filter( 'excerpt_more', 'skeleton_excerpt_more' );

// Navigation
add_filter( 'nav_menu_css_class', 'skeleton_nav_menu_classes', 10, 4 );
add_filter( 'nav_menu_link_attributes', 'skeleton_nav_link_attributes', 10, 4 );
```

## Template Hierarchy

### Key Templates
```
Front Page:   front-page.php → home.php → index.php
Blog Home:    home.php → index.php
Single Post:  single-{post-type}-{slug}.php → single-{post-type}.php → single.php → singular.php → index.php
Page:         page-{slug}.php → page-{id}.php → page.php → singular.php → index.php
Archive:      archive-{post-type}.php → archive.php → index.php
Category:     category-{slug}.php → category-{id}.php → category.php → archive.php → index.php
Author:       author-{nicename}.php → author-{id}.php → author.php → archive.php → index.php
Search:       search.php → index.php
404:          404.php → index.php
```

## Security Checklist

- [ ] All output is escaped with appropriate function
- [ ] All input is sanitized before use
- [ ] All database queries use prepared statements
- [ ] Nonces are used for form submissions
- [ ] Capability checks before sensitive operations
- [ ] No direct file access (check ABSPATH)
- [ ] Text domain used for all translatable strings
- [ ] No hardcoded URLs or paths

## Performance Checklist

- [ ] Scripts loaded in footer with `defer`
- [ ] Styles properly enqueued (not inline)
- [ ] Images lazy loaded
- [ ] Critical CSS inlined if needed
- [ ] No render-blocking resources
- [ ] Proper caching headers for assets
- [ ] Minified CSS/JS in production

## Accessibility Checklist

- [ ] Skip link present
- [ ] Proper heading hierarchy
- [ ] Focus indicators visible
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA
- [ ] Alt text for images
- [ ] ARIA labels where needed
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works
- [ ] Screen reader tested
